{
  "id": "p3-ext-part3",
  "stages": [
    {
      "id": "load-guide",
      "type": "load-video",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "input_url": "out/p3-ext-part2.mp4",
        "enable_audio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-frames",
      "type": "video-to-rgb",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "load-guide",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "output_dtype": "u8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-tail",
      "type": "temporal-slice",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "guide-frames",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "start": -90
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "load-guide-audio",
      "type": "load-audio",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "input_url": "out/p3-ext-part2.mp4",
        "start_s": 1.4167,
        "duration_s": 3.75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-pcm",
      "type": "audio-to-pcm",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "load-guide-audio",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "output_sample_rate": 32000,
        "channels": 2,
        "chunk_duration_s": 3.75,
        "max_chunk_duration_s": 60
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "minimax-h3-model-config",
      "type": "minimax-h3-model-config",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "video_shift": 12.0,
        "audio_shift": 3.0,
        "condition_timestep": 1.0,
        "audio_seconds": 0.0,
        "lora": "Pika-Labs/Pika-H3-Flex-ref2va",
        "lora_scale": 1.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "model-select",
      "type": "model-select",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "hf_dir": "local/MiniMax-H3-Ref2VA-8bit"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stack-guide",
      "type": "temporal-stack",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "guide-tail",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "mode": "video",
        "group_size": 0,
        "max_mb": 384
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stack-pcm",
      "type": "temporal-stack",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "guide-pcm",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "mode": "audio",
        "group_size": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text-prompt",
      "type": "text-prompt",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "text": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the tabby cat in <Video 1>, with brown-and-black striped fur, a light blue denim jacket, white chest fur and pink paw pads.\n<Subject 2> is the worn wooden windowsill in <Video 1>, with flaking varnish, a chipped front edge, and warm sunlight lying across it.\n<Subject 3> is the view through the open window in <Video 1>, with a pale blue house wall, a strip of green hedge, and long late-afternoon shadows.\n<Video 1> is the source video whose final moment the target video continues from.\n<Audio 1> is the synchronized audio track of <Video 1>, providing the purring, the breeze and the distant birdsong to continue.\n\nsummary:\n[video continuation + audio reference] The target video continues directly from the end of <Video 1>. <Subject 1> looks back from the window, gives a slow wide yawn that shows its tongue and small teeth, then blinks twice and settles lower onto <Subject 2>; the purring and the outdoor ambience follow <Audio 1> without copying the signal.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is live-action and cinematic, with warm late-afternoon sunlight, a shallow depth of field, and soft fill light from the open window.\n[Shot 1] The shot continues seamlessly from the final moment of <Video 1>, keeping the same medium close-up and the same slow push-in. <Subject 1> turns its head back from the window toward the camera, opens its mouth in a long yawn that shows a pink tongue and small pale teeth, then closes it and blinks twice with half-closed lids. It lowers its body and settles its weight on <Subject 2>, the denim jacket folding at the shoulder seams. The chipped front edge of the sill and the hedge strip of <Subject 3> keep the same position in frame, so the change is only in the cat's posture and the slightly closer framing.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the same individual tabby cat keeps its brown-and-black striped fur, light blue denim jacket, white chest fur and pink paw pads.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the same worn windowsill with flaking varnish and the same chipped front edge.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the same pale blue house wall, green hedge strip and late-afternoon light direction.\n<Video 1> (continuation starting point): fully_preserved - [Shot 1] starts from the final framing, pose and lighting of <Video 1>.\n<Audio 1>: reference - the purring timbre, the breeze and the birdsong continue in the same character and tempo without copying the original signal.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe purring referenced from <Audio 1> continues, slightly slower as the cat relaxes. The breeze through the window keeps the same soft, continuous character, and the distant birdsong continues. A small creak of old wood as the cat settles its weight on the sill.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNo musical score. Only the natural ambience referenced from <Audio 1> continues."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "video-ref-encoder",
      "type": "video-ref-encoder",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "text-prompt",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "stack-guide",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "stack-pcm",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "frames": 124,
        "reference_video_short_edge": 0,
        "attach_audio": [
          2
        ],
        "max_prompt_tokens": 65536,
        "unload_when_idle": "destroy"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-video",
      "type": "generate-video",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "video-ref-encoder",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "video-ref-encoder",
          "oport": 1
        },
        {
          "src": "video-ref-encoder",
          "oport": 2
        },
        {
          "src": "minimax-h3-model-config",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "height": 480,
        "width": 832,
        "frames": 124,
        "fps": 24,
        "steps": 6,
        "seed": 42,
        "i8_gemm": true,
        "sol_attn": false,
        "unload_when_idle": "destroy"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "audio-vae-decode",
      "type": "audio-vae-decode",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "generate-video",
          "oport": 1
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "vae-decode",
      "type": "vae-decode",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "generate-video",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "rgb-to-video",
      "type": "rgb-to-video",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "vae-decode",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "fps": 24,
        "pix_fmt": "yuv444p",
        "color_range": "full",
        "colorspace": "bt709"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "save-video",
      "type": "save-video",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "rgb-to-video",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "audio-vae-decode",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "output_url": "out/p3-ext-part3.mp4",
        "enable_video": true,
        "enable_audio": true,
        "video_codec": "ffv1",
        "video_bitrate": 10240000,
        "video_gop_size": 24,
        "audio_codec": "alac",
        "audio_bitrate": 192000,
        "muxer_options": {
          "movflags": "+faststart"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "subpipelines": []
}